GNOME Online Accounts
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This gem defines the Goa namespace from `Goa-1.0.typelib`, the GObject
Introspection description GNOME Online Accounts ships. It carries no code from
that project: the typelib is read at require time, from the copy the user's
distribution installed, and nothing is linked, vendored or copied here.

