places no obligation on a user of this gem beyond those that already apply to
having the library installed.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ruby-gnome
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The loader in lib/goa/loader.rb is modelled on ruby-gnome's own loaders --
libsecret/lib/libsecret/loader.rb for a namespace that needs no init call, and
gtksourceview5/lib/gtksourceview5/loader.rb for one that does. The shape is
taken from them; the code is not.

  https://github.com/ruby-gnome/ruby-gnome
  Copyright 2002-2026 Ruby-GNOME Project Team
  Licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or later

`gobject-introspection` and `glib2`, which this gem depends on at runtime, come
from that project and are installed as gems in their own right rather than
redistributed here.
